- TSPLIB95 rounding preserved: `(result + 0.5).astype(int)`
- Broadcasting pattern: `coords[:, None, :] - coords[None, :, :]` creates (n, n, d) pairwise differences

3. **✅ 30 Benchmark Instance Validation** (COMPLETE)
